# `C99`'s narrowing control (`M155`/`D768`). `timeout-narrow-tight.config` with the two numbers
# swapped: the broad key is 10 ms and would fail `/slow` on its own, and the narrow `timeout api`
# overrules it for exactly the request this corpus makes. Green.

defaults
  timeout step 10ms, api 5s

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507"
